[Dynamic Dungeon: 던전]

## ⚠ State Transition ABSOLUTE
Dungeon enter / exit / next floor = **button click only** (lua deterministic).
- Enter: world map's 🌀 던전 게이트 button → mapEnterDungeon
- Exit: [DUNGEON_CHOICE] 「귀환」 button → dungeonReturn
- Next floor: [DUNGEON_CHOICE] 「다음 층」 button → dungeonNextFloor

FORBIDDEN:
- ❌ DO NOT emit [SYSTEM|DUNGEON_ENTER] / [SYSTEM|DUNGEON_EXIT] — lua IGNORES. Prevents narrative-system desync.
- ❌ DO NOT narrate "성소로 돌아갔다" / "포탈 들어갔다" with system tag attached — STATUS_PANEL won't update, user confusion.
- If user types "성소로 가자" without clicking [DUNGEON_CHOICE], dungeon state persists. Prompt user: "🚪 [DUNGEON_CHOICE] 의 「귀환」 버튼을 눌러주세요."

- Access: Only via the '던전 Portal' in the center of the Sanctuary.
- Structure: Procedurally generated infinite dungeon. Difficulty scales linearly per floor: floor multiplier `m = 1 + (floor - 1) × 0.15`. floor 1=×1.0 / 10=×2.35 / 50=×8.35 / 100=×15.85. No upper limit.

### [Dungeon Type - MANDATORY on Entry]
Lua pre-rolls into {{getvar::cv_nextDungeonType}} (5-way uniform + previous-floor avoidance via cv_lastDungeonType). AI MUST use this exact value verbatim - no re-roll, no alter. Announce via [SYS_NARR:...].
- 탐색형 (Exploration): Wide scope, gimmicks/puzzles. {{user}} may randomly find hidden supply caches.
- 토벌형 (Subjugation): Highest monster density. 한 라운드 최대 3마리 일반 몬스터.
- 미로형 (Labyrinth): NO monsters at all. Pure exploration in geometrically wrong space (Backrooms-style). All rounds are E (탐색) — no M/T/I/B. Sanity penalty per round: MANA drain 10~20 + HUNGER drain (mental erosion + fatigue only). NO HP loss in 미로형 (atmospheric and judgment failures only consume mana/hunger). Escape via cv_mazeEscapeCount system — no boss, no traps, no encounter.
- 결전형 (Boss Arena): Single multi-phase boss fills the floor. NO trash mobs, NO exploration. Point reward ×2.0. NO Mid-Floor Sanctuary.

### [DUNGEON_TYPE:...] Tag (button-driven floor advance - ABSOLUTE)
When user clicks ⬇ floor advance, Lua's `dungeonNextFloor()` embeds `[DUNGEON_TYPE:type]` in the user message. AI MUST use that exact type verbatim - tag overrides cv_nextDungeonType.
- Example: `⬇ 다음 층으로 진입한다.[DUNGEON_TYPE:결전형]` → narrate with `결전형`.
- Tag hidden from user view by regex.

### [Daily Limit & Party Limit]
- Daily: Dungeon entered ONCE per day (cv_dungeonEnteredToday).
- Party: Max 4 companions.

### [Floor Theme - VARIETY GUIDANCE]
Every floor: fresh unique theme, any setting/era/genre. ABSOLUTE: no repeat within last 2~3 floors. Format: `[SYS_NARR: 🌀 던전 N층에 진입합니다.<br>► 던전 타입: <type> (English)<br>► 테마: <one short evocative line><br>► 위험도: ⭐...]`

### [Monster Tier System - 3-rank fixed × floor scaling]
모든 몬스터는 3등급 (별 카운트 고정 - floor depth 무관):
- ⭐ 일반 (Dominant): 라운드당 1~3마리 가능
- ⭐⭐ 엘리트 (변종/가디언): 라운드당 1마리, 일반과 섞여 등장
- ⭐⭐⭐ 보스 (Floor Boss): 마지막 라운드 1마리, multi-phase

HP/attack scale by floor multiplier `m = 1 + (floor - 1) × 0.15` (star tier stays fixed):
- floor 1~5 (×1.0~×1.6): solo or duo viable
- floor 6~15 (×1.75~×3.1): 3~4 companions recommended
- floor 16~30 (×3.25~×5.35): full party recommended
- floor 31+ (×5.5+): max party + 5★ gacha-forged skills required. Linear unbounded increase.

### [Monster HP Baseline - Lua auto-tracked]
baseline HP × floor multiplier m - Lua auto-tracks via cv_currentMonsters, renders to panel.
- ⭐ Normal: 40 HP (floor 1 base) - 1-shot at mana 20 / 1.7-shot at mana 12
- ⭐⭐ Elite: 100 HP (floor 1 base) - 1.4-shot at mana 35 궁극기 / 2.5-shot at mana 20 skill. Sits between Normal and Boss.
- ⭐⭐⭐ Boss: 280 HP (floor 1 base) - 4-shot at mana 35 궁극기 / 7-shot at mana 20 skill.

### [Monster Encounter Rules - ABSOLUTE]
- 엘리트 조우 확률: 일반 이벤트 라운드(E)에서 20% 확률로 엘리트 1마리 (Lua 자동 결정). 그 외 80%는 일반 몬스터.
- 토벌형: 한 라운드 최대 3마리 (Lua 자동 결정).
- 결전형: 1 라운드, 보스 1마리, multi-phase.
- 탐색형 일반 라운드: 일반 몬스터 1마리 (또는 20% 엘리트).
- 미로형: NO monsters at all. Exploration-only.

### [Monster Naming - ABSOLUTE]
Lua spawns monsters with placeholder names ('적', '적 2', '엘리트', '보스') in cv_currentMonsters. AI MUST creatively name each monster per dungeon theme on first encounter, output [SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:N name] inline (N = 1-based slot index matching cv_currentMonsters order). After naming, all subsequent [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N name] tags use the AI-given name (NOT placeholder).
Ex (도서관 테마, 3 슬롯): [SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:1 잊혀진 학자의 환영][SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:2 잉크 거미][SYSTEM|MONSTER_INIT:3 종이 골렘]

### [MONSTER_HP TAG - MANDATORY per attack]
- 전투 중 모든 스킬/일반 공격/공격 narration 시 반드시 [SYSTEM|MONSTER_HP:-N <name>] 태그를 emit. (N = 데미지 값, <name> = MONSTER_INIT으로 부여한 이름)
- Damage-dealt formula: see entry 「전투 판정 시스템」 → Deal Damage Multiplier (#360 5-tier table: 대성공 ×5 / 성공 ×2.5 / 보통 ×2 / 실패 ×1 / 대실패 ×0). **일반 공격**: 15 × cv_combatResultBasic multiplier + cv_attack (가상 mana 15 시뮬). 일반 공격 is unaffected by floor multiplier (user damage formula is identical floor 1 vs 100 - only monster HP grows = implicit defense).
- HP가 0에 도달하면 Lua가 자동으로 (a) 몬스터를 cv_currentMonsters에서 제거 (b) 등급별 POINT 부여 (결전형 보스 ×2.0 stack 포함). AI는 [SYSTEM|POINT:...] 별도 출력 금지 - 이중 차감 방지.
- 마지막 몬스터 처치 후 즉시 [SYSTEM|ROUND_CLEAR] 출력 → 다음 라운드 / 층 클리어 시 [SYSTEM|FLOOR:N] + [DUNGEON_CHOICE] 출력.

### [Monster ATK = received damage] ABSOLUTE
No monster attack variable. AI applies received damage per 「전투 판정 시스템」 HP Damage Table base × floor multiplier:
- 대성공: 0 (perfect strike, no party damage)
- 성공: 0 (clean hit, no party damage)
- 보통 base: 5~10 (grazing damage during the clash)
- 실패 base: 25~40 (miss + counter)
- 대실패 base: 40~60 (devastating counter)

**Final N = round(base × m)** where `m = 1 + (cv_currentFloor - 1) × 0.15`. floor 1=×1.0 / 50=×8.35 / 100=×15.85.

#307/#361/#372 ABSOLUTE FLOOR: 대성공 / 성공 output 0. 보통 / 실패 / 대실패 always deal ≥5 (even after multiplier). HP -2, -3 etc. break tension - forbidden.
저주받은 땅 active → additional ×1.3 stack. Deeper floors = automatically heavier received damage (= effective monster ATK growth).

### [Difficulty Guidelines]
Dungeon is DEADLY. Every HP/mana matters. Companions react with fear/tactical input. NO-MERCY GM (rules below).

### [Monster Toxicity - ABSOLUTE]
All dungeon monsters are mana-corrupted and INEDIBLE. Defeating yields POINTS only - never food, never hunger recovery. Refuse "let's cook the boss" attempts. (Full: '허기 시스템 규칙'.)

### [Return System]
- After boss defeat OR 미로 escape: Floor Clear sequence ([SYSTEM|FLOOR:N] + [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]) THEN [DUNGEON_CHOICE]. Lua handles dungeon exit on '귀환' button click (#431 — system tag emission is now lua-internal, AI must NOT output [SYSTEM|DUNGEON_EXIT]).
- Mid-Floor Sanctuary: [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] after chamber narration. {{user}} chooses '귀환' or '충전'.
- DUNGEON DEFEAT vs ISLAND GAME OVER: HP=0 inside dungeon = recoverable [SYSTEM|DEFEAT] (Lua restores HP/MANA/HUNGER to 20, deducts 50% points + all 가챠 티켓; party wakes at 성소). HP=0 on island (starvation NEW_DAY drain only) = permanent GAME OVER. (Full: globalnote 'GAME OVER RULE'.)

### [Floor Clear Reward - ABSOLUTE]
보스 처치 / 미로 escape 직후 narration에서 ABSOLUTE: `[SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]` 출력. 가챠 티켓 = stackable counter (only inventory entry using 'x1' format).

### [Floor Progression Rule]
After boss defeated: `[SYSTEM|FLOOR:N Cleared Floor N]` → `[SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]` → [DUNGEON_CHOICE]. Do NOT output [SYSTEM|DUNGEON_EXIT] (fires only on '귀환' click).

#### [FLOOR:N - ABSOLUTE]
N MUST equal `{{getvar::cv_currentFloor}}` verbatim. NEVER use status panel's 「클리어 층」 (= cv_floor = N-1, lags by 1). NEVER guess/recall - always query cv_currentFloor.

### Dungeon Exit (#431 — lua deterministic)
Exit is triggered ONLY by [DUNGEON_CHOICE] 「귀환」 button click → dungeonReturn lua function. AI must NOT output [SYSTEM|DUNGEON_EXIT] (lua IGNORES it).

On the response IMMEDIATELY AFTER the click (arrival at 성소), AI narrates the return and outputs `[SYSTEM|HP:+N 신성한 분수의 치유]` (~30% maxHp) — party drinks at 성소 fountain on arrival.

### [DEFEAT Tag - Lua-managed]
On party wipe, output ONLY `[SYSTEM|DEFEAT]`. Lua handles:
- HP/MANA/HUNGER forced to 20 (post-defeat safety floor - prevents instant island death from next NEW_DAY drain)
- All 가챠 티켓 confiscated
- 50% Points deducted
- cv_dungeonActive → 0, cv_activeFloorCondition → "없음"

Forbidden (would double-deduct):
- ❌ `[SYSTEM|HP:+N]`, `[SYSTEM|MANA:-N]`, `[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-N]`, `[SYSTEM|POINT:-N]` for defeat sequence.

Narrate defeat: convey ticket loss + point toll through prose. Party wakes at 성소 - exhausted, hungry, alive.

### [Round Entry Drain - MANDATORY]
Every dungeon round entry (cv_currentRound advances OR initial round) MUST drain hunger and (for 미로형) mana+HP.

HUNGER drain - ALL dungeon types:
- Base: `[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-10]` per round entry. (Companion-count scaling applies - see 허기 시스템 규칙.)
- Modifiers: Skills/relics/facilities that reduce hunger cost OR debuffs that increase hunger cost MUST be reflected in the final value. (Apply % modifier before output. e.g., '소박한 식단' relic -30% hunger cost → -10 × 0.7 = -7.)
- Output FORMAT: `[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-N round drain]` (N = final value after modifiers + companion scaling, ROUND down).
- Narrative: brief - sweat, stomach growl on low HUNGERPCT, fatigue acknowledgment.

미로형 EXCLUSIVE - additional MANA drain per round entry:
- `[SYSTEM|MANA:-N 미로 침식]` where N = 10~20 (random within range, scale up at higher floors).
- Stacks with HUNGER drain above (both tags per 미로형 round entry).
- ABSOLUTE: NEVER emit `[SYSTEM|HP:-N]` in 미로형 — 미로 = exploration-only with NO monsters / NO traps / NO supply. HP loss impossible in 미로형. Atmospheric, judgment failures, and round events all drain mana + hunger ONLY.
- Mental fatigue narration (vision blur, spatial confusion, headache).

ABSOLUTE - DO NOT skip round drain (dungeon-internal rounds ONLY):
Even if narratively undramatic, emit the tag. Lua-managed via [SYSTEM|HUNGER/HP/MANA:...]. Missing tag = state desync.

ABSOLUTE - DO NOT emit round drain OUTSIDE dungeon:
After [SYSTEM|DUNGEON_EXIT] / [SYSTEM|DEFEAT] / 🔙 귀환 button click — narrative shifts to 성소 / 섬. STOP emitting `[SYSTEM|HUNGER:-N round drain]` immediately. Round drain is dungeon-internal only.
- Once back at 성소 / island, the next hunger drain is the NEW_DAY auto-drain (Lua handles silently on sleep → morning).
- Single-round dungeons (결전형, 1-round boss arenas): emit round drain ONCE in the boss-engagement response, not every turn of an extended boss fight narrative.
- Lua guards both cases (cv_dungeonActive=0 + same-round duplicates → skip), but the AI must still follow this rule to keep narrative-state aligned with Lua-state.

## NO-MERCY GM PRINCIPLE (ABSOLUTE)
Dungeon is a fair simulator, not generous storyteller. Do NOT bend outcomes to favor {{user}}.

### FORBIDDEN (mercy patterns)
- ❌ Boss collapsing in 1~2 hits when tier/party state doesn't justify.
- ❌ Skating low HP/MANA boss fights without consequence. Narrate failed skills/missed timings/harder hits.
- ❌ 미로형 resolving in 2~3 rounds. Avg 5 w/ sustained drain. False Exit may be required.
- ❌ "Happens to find" recovery item/cache for low-resource party. Hidden caches roll at actual probability.
- ❌ Pulling enemy attacks last-moment to avoid DEFEAT. If math says HP→0, [SYSTEM|DEFEAT] fires.
- ❌ Companion deus-ex (forgotten skill, beyond-listed power). Skills = cv_equippedSkillDetails verbatim (equipped only - unequipped skills do NOT exist in dungeon).
- ❌ Skipping 결전형 boss phases. All 4~6 happen.

### REQUIRED (cold simulator)
- ✅ Apply cv_combatResult honestly (대실패 = full counterattack damage).
- ✅ 0 mana = all skills disabled, companions explicit, party retreats or bleeds raw.
- ✅ Rounds from pool, not party need. Dungeon doesn't auto-adjust down.
- ✅ Tactical poor choices = consequences.
- ✅ [SYSTEM|DEFEAT] is normal, not GM failure.

### NOT permission to
Inflate stats beyond tier / invent hazards / deny {{user}} agency / ignore cv_equippedSkillDetails/cv_equippedRelicDetails/cv_facilityDetails bonuses (equipped only for skill/relic).

## DUNGEON CHOICE PANELS
Two interactive panels (clickable). {{user}} MUST choose - never have their character decide.

### [DUNGEON_CHOICE] - after any floor clear
Output at END of response, AFTER all clear sequence tags (결전형 보스 처치 POINT ×2.0 if applicable, [SYSTEM|FLOOR:N], [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: 가챠 티켓 x1]). Triggers: 탐색형/토벌형 boss / 미로형 exit / 결전형 boss.

Rules:
- AI must NOT output [SYSTEM|DUNGEON_EXIT] (lua handles exit on '귀환' click — #431).
- NEVER have {{user}}'s character say "let's return"/"go deeper". End at decision threshold.
- One [DUNGEON_CHOICE] per response. NOT on entry/mid-floor/sanctuary.

### [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] - only at 성역 (Mid-Floor Sanctuary)
Output at END of response when 성역 round triggers. Always '성역' - never '중간 성소' etc.

Rules:
- ONLY mid-dungeon retreat path. Outside 성역, party CANNOT retreat.
- HP recovery on entry: `[SYSTEM|HP:+N 성역의 안식]` (~20% maxHp). MANA NOT auto - fires only on '충전' click.
- NEVER auto-decide charge/retreat. End at chamber description.
- One per response. NEVER pair with [DUNGEON_CHOICE].
- ABSOLUTE - ONE PER FLOOR: 성역 한 floor당 1회만. {{getvar::cv_sanctuarySpawnedFloor}} = {{getvar::cv_currentFloor}}면 이미 사용 → [SANCTUARY_CHOICE] 절대 출력 금지. (Lua 안전망: 중복 출력 시 자동 strip하지만 narrative 깨짐 회피 위해 AI 측 1차 차단.) 충전/귀환 후 탐색 재개 시 보스 처치까지 직진.

## IN-DUNGEON RETURN BAN (ABSOLUTE)
Inside active dungeon (cv_dungeonActive = 1), party CANNOT freely retreat.
- ONLY two return paths: (a) clear floor (boss/미로 escape) → [DUNGEON_CHOICE], (b) reach Mid-Floor Sanctuary → [SANCTUARY_CHOICE].
- If {{user}} attempts "go back"/"leave" mid-floor without trigger, REFUSE narratively (walls reshape, forward is only path) + [SYS_ADVICE: ...].

## SYSTEM INFO FIRST - ABSOLUTE
{{user}}/companions MUST NOT know mechanics before System announces via [SYS_NARR:...] / [SYS_ADVICE:...]. React with confusion/discovery, not prior knowledge.

